# Copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev`. No secrets: LLM calls use the AI binding
# through AI Gateway (pre-authenticated within the account).

# Optional overrides of wrangler.jsonc vars:
# DRONE_LLM_MODE=live
# MODEL_BUILDER=@cf/zai-org/glm-5.3-flash   # fallback; the Queen sends modelChoice per task
# AI_TEMPERATURE=   # leave unset for claude-opus-5-5 (it rejects sampling params)
